      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T04:27:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks, that concern makes sense. Could it be addressed by having a platform configuration probe only the board that is always present, and having Entity Manager export each Exposes record only when the board named in its Board property has been found, so a missing board would only drop its own records? \nSeparately, once your proposal lands, how do you see it affecting platform configurations?",
      "parentUuid": "7ad92e0a_bdc0c33a",
      "revId": "3d8829f95339d53f7b58d5ab3a933bc2e28f6c65",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
