      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T00:15:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding was that the need for platform configurations was to apply properties to devices based on context that provided the global/aggregate system configuration. In which case, if anything supporting that global context is absent, the platform configuration can\u0027t be applied as a whole.\n\nMy proposal can be used in parallel to platform configurations. In some cases it can be used instead of platform configurations.",
      "parentUuid": "8c8b3a38_a422a4f3",
      "revId": "3d8829f95339d53f7b58d5ab3a933bc2e28f6c65",
